<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Unreciprocated Love</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Rocco</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Unreciprocated Love</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2Vkb3xMxt1UU2A9wImJcJo</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">1 Contributor</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Unreciprocated Love Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wake up in the morning and you're wearing my shirt</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You say, "You're late for work" so I ask, "where we'll do it again?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She said, "Don't get me wrong last night was a ten</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I can't do commitment hope you understand it"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Laying in my bed thinking (Damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She not feelin' what I was feelin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">That lowkey kinda hurt but I think we'll make it work</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hope we make it work</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's that unreciprocated love (Love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">That knows how to keep me up (Up)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Red solo cups, Runnin' out of luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yo, yo, yo switch it up switch it up)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's that unreciprocated love (love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">That knows how to keep me up (Up)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Red solo cups, runnin' out of luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause she don't give a fuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah it really sucks</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Dash ridin' all around her street (Damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All you gotta do is give me time (What)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Some time to just reminisce</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Fantasies I make up in my mind (Ay, ay, ay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I get impatient</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This time that I'm wasting</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lost in your fragrance</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna fake it no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I could treat you right baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just give me the time (Woah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'd do whatever you like baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just make sure you're mine[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's that unreciprocated love (Love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">That knows how to keep me up (Up)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Red solo cups, runnin' out of luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah it really sucks</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's that unreciprocated love (love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">That knows how to keep me up (Up)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Red solo cups, runnin' out of luck</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause she don't give a fuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah it really sucks</p></div></body></tt>